    "text": "By Tara Brolley ,\n10 hours ago HAYS COUNTY, Texas — The West Travis County Public Utility Agency issued a boil water notice Wednesday morning for approximately 11,000 customers in its Highway 290 service region after an equipment failure caused water tank levels to drop critically low. The notice affects customers in northern Hays County, along... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
